WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.013 --> 00:00:04.206
Toad splashed his arms in the water.

2
00:00:04.207 --> 00:00:07.487
The water was flowing fast.

3
00:00:07.488 --> 00:00:11.377
He held his head above the waves.

4
00:00:11.378 --> 00:00:15.485
"I'm in the river!" he cried.

5
00:00:15.486 --> 00:00:19.088
The waves turned him over.

6
00:00:19.089 --> 00:00:23.959
"Oh my!" Toad yelled. "Help!"

7
00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:26.601
His head went under.

8
00:00:26.602 --> 00:00:30.698
He swallowed a gulp of water.

9
00:00:30.699 --> 00:00:33.206
Toad's head popped up again.

10
00:00:33.207 --> 00:00:35.787
He coughed.

11
00:00:35.788 --> 00:00:40.289
"I'll never steal another car!" cried Toad.

12
00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:44.922
"I'll never sing another song!"

13
00:00:44.923 --> 00:00:48.425
Under the water he went again.

14
00:00:48.426 --> 00:00:52.066
"Oh dear," he said with a splash.

15
00:00:52.067 --> 00:00:55.553
His head popped up once more.

16
00:00:55.554 --> 00:01:01.589
"I'll never tell another lie!" he cried.

17
00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:05.660
Toad grabbed the reeds on the bank.

18
00:01:05.661 --> 00:01:10.184
But the reeds broke off in his hands.

19
00:01:10.185 --> 00:01:14.387
In the riverbank ahead was a round hole.

20
00:01:14.388 --> 00:01:19.646
"Maybe I can grab onto it," said Toad.

21
00:01:19.647 --> 00:01:23.111
"Here it comes!" cried Toad.

22
00:01:23.112 --> 00:01:26.279
The waves carried him closer.

23
00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:31.251
Now the dark opening was just above him.

24
00:01:31.252 --> 00:01:35.410
Toad reached for the edge of the hole.

25
00:01:35.411 --> 00:01:40.684
"I made it!" said Toad, holding on.

26
00:01:40.685 --> 00:01:44.589
He was only halfway out of the water.

27
00:01:44.590 --> 00:01:49.346
"I'll catch my breath here," he said.

28
00:01:49.347 --> 00:01:53.957
Two bright eyes shone out of the hole.

29
00:01:53.958 --> 00:01:57.002
"What's that?" said Toad.

30
00:01:57.003 --> 00:02:01.188
Then a small brown face appeared.

31
00:02:01.189 --> 00:02:03.733
It was Rat!

